---
// Proven on the Wire / Dotted World Map Section (Section 6)
---

<section class="t-rv border-t border-[var(--tnx-line-1)]" id="proven-on-wire-section">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-7 py-18 md:py-[72px] max-[620px]:px-[18px]">
    <!-- 2-Column Header -->
    <div class="t-g2 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-[48px] items-start mb-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="tnx-eyebrow">PROVEN ON THE WIRE</div>
        <h2 class="tnx-h2-sm max-w-[20ch]">Cross-cloud, on real infrastructure.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="font-normal text-[15.5px] leading-[1.66] text-[#A9A9A6] text-pretty pt-1">
        Site-to-site between AWS Sydney and Azure West US, un-NAT'd, under enforcing policy. Capabilities ship after they are demonstrated end to end: the record states which ones were.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Dotted Map Web Component Container (No Card Border) -->
    <div class="w-full relative min-h-[340px]">
      <tunnex-dotted-map link-label="138 ms"></tunnex-dotted-map>

      <!-- Mono Legend Strip -->
      <div class="mt-2.5 pt-3 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap text-[9.5px] font-mono font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-[#6E6E6B] uppercase">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 flex-wrap">
          <span>WIREGUARD SITE-TO-SITE</span>
          <span>138 MS · UN-NAT'D</span>
          <span>ROUTES RECONCILED BY THE AGENTS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="font-medium text-[#454542] tracking-[0.12em] ml-auto">
          ILLUSTRATIVE · AGENT PRINCIPALS ARE ROADMAP
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Scripts required by tunnex-dotted-map.js Web Component -->
<script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/d3@7"></script>
<script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/topojson-client@3"></script>
<script is:inline src="/assets/tunnex-dotted-map.js"></script>
